# Keeps this directory tracked. Its contents are not.
#
# scripts/seed-sources.ts reads three PDFs from here to populate a fresh
# database, then uploads them to Blob storage. The files themselves are
# gitignored: they are published, copyrighted course readings, and this repo is
# public. Drop your own copies here before running `npm run seed:sources` — the
# script names the three it expects and will tell you if one is missing.
#
# Nothing at runtime reads this directory. The app's only storage backend is the
# private Vercel Blob store (src/lib/storage.ts).
